# desc: 1M-token context with the fp8 KV cache (@Nanetnounou): x1.9 KV, at a speed and some quality cost
# NOTE (2026-10-03): we do NOT run this profile in production — fp8 KV corrupts verbatim recall
# (URLs, paths, tool args) on content-heavy contexts; issue #6 closed with that decision. Kept as a
# documented opt-in for users who need the 1M pool more than exact recall. Default stays bf16.
# See docs/HOW-IT-WORKS.md#fp8-kv-cache-on-the-qsa-path-opt-in
MODE=hybrid
YARN=1
CTX=1000000
KV_DTYPE=fp8_e4m3
